{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-model-landscape","title":"生成模型全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/generative-model-landscape","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成模型全景\">生成模型全景</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生成模型的目标是学习数据的概率分布 p(x)，从而能够采样产生与训练数据同分布的新样本。与判别模型关注条件概率 p(y|x) 不同，生成模型需要捕获数据的完整统计结构，包括各维度之间的联合分布和依赖关系。这一根本差异使得生成模型的训练更加困难，但也赋予了它更强的表达能力和更广泛的应用潜力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[生成模型] --&gt; B[显式密度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[隐式密度]&#10;    B --&gt; D[精确推断]&#10;    B --&gt; E[近似推断]&#10;    D --&gt; F[自回归模型]&#10;    D --&gt; G[标准化流]&#10;    E --&gt; H[VAE]&#10;    E --&gt; I[扩散模型]&#10;    C --&gt; J[GAN]&#10;    C --&gt; K[能量模型]\">graph TD\n    A[生成模型] --&gt; B[显式密度]\n    A --&gt; C[隐式密度]\n    B --&gt; D[精确推断]\n    B --&gt; E[近似推断]\n    D --&gt; F[自回归模型]\n    D --&gt; G[标准化流]\n    E --&gt; H[VAE]\n    E --&gt; I[扩散模型]\n    C --&gt; J[GAN]\n    C --&gt; K[能量模型]</pre><p>生成模型按照是否显式建模概率密度函数可以分为两大类。显式密度模型直接定义并优化数据的对数似然，包括精确推断的自回归模型和标准化流，以及近似推断的 VAE 和扩散模型。隐式密度模型不直接建模概率密度，而是通过对抗训练或能量函数间接学习数据分布，GAN 是其中最典型的代表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型类别</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>密度建模</th>\n<th>采样速度</th>\n<th>训练稳定性</th>\n<th>生成质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自回归模型</td>\n<td>GPT, PixelCNN</td>\n<td>精确对数似然</td>\n<td>慢（逐步生成）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变分自编码器</td>\n<td>VAE, VQ-VAE</td>\n<td>变分下界</td>\n<td>快（单步解码）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成对抗网络</td>\n<td>GAN, StyleGAN</td>\n<td>隐式</td>\n<td>快（单步生成）</td>\n<td>低（模式崩塌）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准化流</td>\n<td>Glow, RealNVP</td>\n<td>精确对数似然</td>\n<td>快（单步反向）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散模型</td>\n<td>DDPM, LDM</td>\n<td>变分下界</td>\n<td>慢（多步去噪）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量模型</td>\n<td>EBM</td>\n<td>非归一化密度</td>\n<td>慢（MCMC 采样）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自回归生成范式\">自回归生成范式</h2><p>自回归模型将联合分布分解为条件概率的连乘：p(x) = ∏ p(xᵢ | x₁, ..., xᵢ₋₁)。这种分解天然地满足概率的链式法则，因此能够提供精确的对数似然计算。在文本生成领域，GPT 系列模型正是基于这一范式取得了突破性进展。</p>\n<p>在图像生成中，PixelCNN 将像素按照光栅扫描顺序排列，逐像素预测条件概率。每个像素的生成依赖于其左侧和上方已生成的像素，通过掩码卷积确保因果约束。PixelCNN++ 引入了门控机制和混合 Logistic 分布来改进离散概率建模。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class MaskedConv2d(nn.Conv2d):&#10;    def __init__(self, mask_type, *args, **kwargs):&#10;        super().__init__(*args, **kwargs)&#10;        self.register_buffer(&#39;mask&#39;, self.weight.data.clone())&#10;        _, _, h, w = self.weight.size()&#10;        self.mask.fill_(1)&#10;        self.mask[:, :, h // 2, w // 2 + (mask_type == &#39;B&#39;):] = 0&#10;        self.mask[:, :, h // 2 + 1:] = 0&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        self.weight.data *= self.mask&#10;        return super().forward(x)&#10;&#10;class PixelCNN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, channels=64, n_layers=7):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        layers = [MaskedConv2d(&#39;A&#39;, 1, channels, 7, padding=3)]&#10;        for _ in range(n_layers - 1):&#10;            layers.extend([nn.ReLU(), MaskedConv2d(&#39;B&#39;, channels, channels, 7, padding=3)])&#10;        layers.extend([nn.ReLU(), nn.Conv2d(channels, 256, 1)])&#10;        self.net = nn.Sequential(*layers)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.net(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MaskedConv2d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Conv2d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, mask_type, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.register_buffer(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mask'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight.data.clone())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        _, _, h, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight.size()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask.fill_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask[:, :, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mask_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask[:, :, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weight.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().forward(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PixelCNN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [MaskedConv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            layers.extend([nn.ReLU(), MaskedConv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, channels, channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.extend([nn.ReLU(), nn.Conv2d(channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.net(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自回归模型的主要局限在于顺序生成导致的推理速度瓶颈。生成一张 256×256 的图像需要 65536 步前向传播，这在实际应用中难以接受。WaveNet 在音频领域面临类似问题。虽然并行化技术（如 Parallel WaveNet 中的逆自回归流）可以一定程度上缓解，但在图像领域的并行化仍然是开放问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对抗生成与隐式建模\">对抗生成与隐式建模</h2><p>GAN 通过引入博弈论框架回避了显式密度建模的困难。生成器 G 将随机噪声映射为数据样本，判别器 D 区分真实样本和生成样本，二者通过极小极大博弈共同优化。这种对抗训练的精妙之处在于，当博弈达到纳什均衡时，生成器的输出分布理论上等于真实数据分布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Z[随机噪声 z] --&gt; G[生成器 G]&#10;    G --&gt; GX[生成样本]&#10;    RX[真实样本] --&gt; D[判别器 D]&#10;    GX --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; R{真/假}&#10;    R --&gt;|梯度| G&#10;    R --&gt;|梯度| D\">graph LR\n    Z[随机噪声 z] --&gt; G[生成器 G]\n    G --&gt; GX[生成样本]\n    RX[真实样本] --&gt; D[判别器 D]\n    GX --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; R{真/假}\n    R --&gt;|梯度| G\n    R --&gt;|梯度| D</pre><p>GAN 的优势在于生成速度快（单次前向传播）且生成质量高，尤其在人脸生成领域达到了照片级真实感。然而，GAN 的训练以不稳定著称，模式崩塌（mode collapse）是核心难题——生成器可能只学会产生少数几种输出而忽略数据分布的其他模式。Wasserstein GAN 通过改用 Earth Mover 距离作为目标函数，显著改善了训练稳定性，但并未完全解决问题。</p>\n<p>GAN 的理论分析涉及最优传输理论、积分概率度量和 f-散度家族。不同的判别器目标函数对应不同的概率散度度量：原始 GAN 最小化 Jensen-Shannon 散度，f-GAN 推广到任意 f-散度，WGAN 使用 Wasserstein-1 距离。理解这些理论联系有助于选择合适的训练策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变分推断与隐变量模型\">变分推断与隐变量模型</h2><p>VAE 将生成过程建模为隐变量模型：先从先验分布 p(z) 采样隐变量 z，再通过解码器 p(x|z) 生成数据。由于后验分布 p(z|x) 通常不可解析计算，VAE 引入一个编码器 q(z|x) 来近似后验，并通过最大化证据下界（ELBO）来训练整个模型。</p>\n<p>ELBO = E[log p(x|z)] - KL(q(z|x) || p(z))，其中第一项是重构损失，鼓励解码器准确还原输入；第二项是 KL 散度正则项，约束后验分布接近先验。这个目标函数的优雅之处在于同时训练了编码器和解码器，并保证了隐空间的正则性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class VAE(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, input_dim=784, hidden_dim=400, latent_dim=20):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(input_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.fc_mu = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, latent_dim)&#10;        self.fc_logvar = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, latent_dim)&#10;        self.decoder = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(latent_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, input_dim), nn.Sigmoid()&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def reparameterize(self, mu, logvar):&#10;        std = torch.exp(0.5 * logvar)&#10;        eps = torch.randn_like(std)&#10;        return mu + eps * std&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        h = self.encoder(x.view(-1, 784))&#10;        mu, logvar = self.fc_mu(h), self.fc_logvar(h)&#10;        z = self.reparameterize(mu, logvar)&#10;        recon = self.decoder(z)&#10;        return recon, mu, logvar&#10;&#10;def vae_loss(recon, x, mu, logvar):&#10;    bce = F.binary_cross_entropy(recon, x.view(-1, 784), reduction=&#39;sum&#39;)&#10;    kld = -0.5 * torch.sum(1 + logvar - mu.pow(2) - logvar.exp())&#10;    return bce + kld\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VAE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, input_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">784</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hidden_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, latent_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(input_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_mu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_dim, latent_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_logvar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_dim, latent_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(latent_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, input_dim), nn.Sigmoid()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reparameterize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, mu, logvar):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logvar)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        eps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(std)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> std</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(x.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">784</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mu, logvar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_mu(h), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_logvar(h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reparameterize(mu, logvar)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        recon </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder(z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon, mu, logvar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> vae_loss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(recon, x, mu, logvar):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bce </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.binary_cross_entropy(recon, x.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">784</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kld </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logvar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu.pow(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logvar.exp())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bce </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kld</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重参数化技巧（Reparameterization Trick）是 VAE 的关键创新。它将随机采样过程 z = μ + σε 重写为确定性函数加外部噪声，使得梯度可以通过 μ 和 σ 反向传播到编码器。这一技巧解决了随机节点不可微分的问题，是变分推断与深度学习结合的桥梁。</p>\n<p>VQ-VAE 引入向量量化（Vector Quantization）取代连续隐空间，将编码映射到离散码本中最近的向量。这避免了 KL 散度坍缩（posterior collapse）问题，并为自回归先验模型提供了离散token序列，在图像和语音合成中表现优异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩散模型的崛起\">扩散模型的崛起</h2><p>扩散模型（Diffusion Models）通过定义一个逐步向数据添加噪声的前向过程，以及学习逆向去噪的反向过程来实现生成。DDPM（Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models）将前向过程定义为马尔可夫链，每一步添加少量高斯噪声，经过 T 步后数据完全变为纯噪声。反向过程同样是马尔可夫链，由神经网络参数化每一步的去噪分布。</p>\n<p>扩散模型在数学上与去噪得分匹配（denoising score matching）和随机微分方程（SDE）有深刻联系。Score-based 视角将生成过程理解为沿数据分布的得分函数（梯度方向）进行的 Langevin 动力学采样。这一统一框架由 Song 等人在 2021 年提出，将离散的扩散步骤推广为连续的 SDE。</p>\n<p>扩散模型之所以在 2022 年后迅速崛起，主要得益于三个方面的突破：一是 Latent Diffusion Model（LDM）将扩散过程从像素空间迁移到隐空间，大幅降低计算成本；二是 Classifier-Free Guidance 提供了强大的条件生成控制机制；三是与大规模文本编码器（如 CLIP）结合，实现了高质量的文本到图像生成。Stable Diffusion 正是这些技术的集大成者。</p>\n<p>与 GAN 相比，扩散模型的训练目标是简单的去噪均方误差，不存在对抗训练的不稳定性；与 VAE 相比，扩散模型的多步去噪过程提供了更强的生成能力。其主要代价是推理速度——标准 DDPM 需要数百到上千步采样。后续的 DDIM、DPM-Solver 等加速算法将采样步数缩减到 20-50 步甚至更少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((生成模型全景))&#10;    自回归模型&#10;      精确对数似然&#10;      顺序生成&#10;      GPT / PixelCNN&#10;    GAN&#10;      对抗训练&#10;      隐式密度&#10;      快速采样&#10;    VAE&#10;      变分推断&#10;      ELBO 优化&#10;      隐空间正则&#10;    扩散模型&#10;      去噪生成&#10;      训练稳定&#10;      质量领先&#10;    标准化流&#10;      可逆变换&#10;      精确似然\">mindmap\n  root((生成模型全景))\n    自回归模型\n      精确对数似然\n      顺序生成\n      GPT / PixelCNN\n    GAN\n      对抗训练\n      隐式密度\n      快速采样\n    VAE\n      变分推断\n      ELBO 优化\n      隐空间正则\n    扩散模型\n      去噪生成\n      训练稳定\n      质量领先\n    标准化流\n      可逆变换\n      精确似然</pre><ul>\n<li>生成模型按密度建模方式分为显式（自回归、流、VAE、扩散）和隐式（GAN、能量模型）两大类</li>\n<li>自回归模型提供精确对数似然但推理速度受限于顺序生成</li>\n<li>GAN 通过对抗博弈实现快速高质量生成，但训练不稳定且易模式崩塌</li>\n<li>VAE 基于变分推断学习正则化隐空间，重参数化技巧是其核心创新</li>\n<li>扩散模型凭借训练稳定性和生成质量成为当前主流，隐空间扩散大幅降低了计算成本</li>\n<li>各类模型各有优劣，实际应用中需根据质量、速度和可控性需求选择合适的方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成模型全景","id":"生成模型全景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自回归生成范式","id":"自回归生成范式"},{"level":2,"text":"对抗生成与隐式建模","id":"对抗生成与隐式建模"},{"level":2,"text":"变分推断与隐变量模型","id":"变分推断与隐变量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"扩散模型的崛起","id":"扩散模型的崛起"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"概率生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/probabilistic-generative-models"}}